window.products.push({"id":517091,"name":"Naidiler 4 Pcs Boston Fern Faux Hanging Plants Artificial Hanging Vines Fake Greenery for Room,Garden, Wall Decor Indoor & Outdoor Wedding Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-TobKHiXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[FULL AND LUSH]The faux Boston fern hanging plants have 81 pcs of branches with thick leaves and the whole is full of vitality. The artificial fern plant has good variation in the colors (from dark green to light green) and length which help it look more lifelike and elegant. [SUITABLE FOR INDOOR AND OUTDOOR] Made of water proof plastic, the fake vines plants can hold up themselves nicely in the sun and rain. The artificial hanging fern plant can brighten up the space indoors and outdoors. You can hand them on bedroom, bathroom, celling, kitchen, wall, balcony, porch, window boxes, porch, fence, patio, and yard. [STURDY AND EASY FOR INSTALLATION] The plastic Boston ferns have iron wires built in the stems, so they are sturdy and bendable. If a little piece fell off you just put it back on. The fake hanging ivy vines can be easily organized and fixed on hanging baskets, wall pots, wood boxes, outdoor containers, hanging pots and fences. [IDEAL HANGING DECORATIONS FOR HOME] Naidiler artificial hanging vines can perfectly match anywhere and any theme home by adding a touch of nature and green. Except used as hanging plants, the fake ferns ivy can also be put along with the real climbing plants to get a fuller looking or made into separate vines for flower arrangement or craft projects or as a replacement for floral flowers when they fell off. [WORTHY BATCH DECORATION APPLICATION] There are totally 4 pcs faux hanging ivy vines included in one bag (each pcs: 5 stems with 81 branches, the whole is approx. 0.8 meter /32 inches long). Batch application is more cost-effective, you can use 2-3 vines to create a full hanging basket. Click \"Add to cart\" to beautify your home right now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-TobKHiXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naidiler","source_asin":"B08K2S1TMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K2S1TMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K2S1TMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
