window.products.push({"id":517155,"name":"Keepax Digital Kitchen Scales - 11lb/5kg, 1g/0.1oz - High Accuracy Multifunction Food Cooking Scale with Fingerprint Resistant Coating … (Black10)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WjEkykUHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking the right proportions of ingredients delivers healthier living——First, you need a Keepax K1 Pro Digital Kitchen Scale.  The K1 Pro Digital Kitchen Food/Meat Scale has a modern design and a high quality 304 stainless steel fingerprint-resistant surface that makes it safe and fashionable. The screen is a clear LCD display for the busy chef. This stylish scale perfectly accents any kitchen setting.  Our digital kitchen scale not only has a built-in high-precision strain gauge sensor system but also an auto tare/zero function, auto-off function and warning indications for the versatility and convenience you need. Whether your focus is diet management, healthy diet monitoring or culinary excellence, it can meet all your demands.  Specification:  Capacity: 0.1oz/1g - 11lb/5000g Division: 0.1oz/1g Unit: lb:oz, g,ml, and oz Dimensions of the scale: 217.5*152*19MM Net weight:225g  Care & Package List Cleaning & Care:  1.Clean the scale with a slightly damp cloth. DO NOT immerse the scale in water or use chemical/abrasive cleaning agents. 2.All plastic parts should be cleaned immediately after contact with fats, spices, vinegar and strongly flavored/colored foods. Avoid contact with acids citru juices. 3.Always use the scale on a hard, flat surface.DO NOT use on carpet.  Package Included:  1 x Digital Kitchen Scale 2 x AAA battery","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WjEkykUHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keepax","source_asin":"B07MKPZCD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKPZCD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKPZCD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
