window.products.push({"id":517195,"name":"Brilloo Silicone Reusable Food Storage Bag, Bundle | Meal Prep Bag |Travel, Makeup| Freezer, Oven, Microwave, Dishwasher Safe, Leakproof Container 6-P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817+S2I0vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It was a typical summer day in the small coastal town of New Haven. The sun was shining, the ocean breeze blew gently across the shoreline, and all seemed right with the world. But there was something brewing beneath the surface that nobody quite realized yet; an environmental crisis on their doorstep.The local population had grown exponentially over recent years, and many people began to realize that their single-use plastic bags were having a devastating effect on both marine life and landfills alike. It wasn't until one brave mom decided to take matters into her own hands that really started to turn around for good.The mom launched Brilloo Reusable Bags—platinum-grade freezer bags made from pure food-grade silicone—and they knew it could be just what they needed to make a difference in their community while also saving money.After trying out these reusable ziploc bags for themselves, word spread quickly around town about how convenient yet eco-friendly these bags were! Everyone wanted them: parents wanting to pack healthy snacks for kids in school; beachgoers looking for a way to carry food, and skincare products; even restaurants using them to:❄️Freeze 🍲Sous-vide 🧁Bake 🔥Microwave as part of their sustainable practices! Before long, everyone in New Haven had converted from single-use plastics over to Brilloo's high quality and economically priced Platinum Grade Reusable Ziploc Bags.Join hands with that Mom to provide these bags to a much larger audience.But why Brilloo? there are other silicone bags in the market.Brilloo bags are a perfect mix of high quality and economically priced platinum-grade food bags, Mom found out good quality bags were highly priced making it out of reach for many, on the other hand, all the low-cost reusable bags had thin walls and poor designs resulting in early rupture and further increasing customers buying frequency, Hence a middle solution needed to be introduced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817+S2I0vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brilloo","source_asin":"B0B61TH77G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B61TH77G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B61TH77G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
