window.products.push({"id":517215,"name":"8 Pieces 100% Cotton Solid Grey King Goose Down Bed in a Bag Set Including 300TC (Sheet Set + Duvet Cover Set) + All Season White Striped Goose Down C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PKVU6S+rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"sheetsnthings is now offering YOUR DREAM of an 8 PIECE GOOSE DOWN BEDDING SET just through ONE CLICK! Enjoy a RESTFUL NIGHT'S SLEEP under the Perfect Warmth of our Soft All Season Goose Down Duvet Insert (Comforter) with the Outstanding Box Stitch construction design that keeps fill evenly distributed at 600 Fill Power With a Pure Cotton Shell Woven at 300 Thread Count. To Provide an ELEGANT LOOK to YOUR BED, we combined this bed set with our 100 Percent Cotton, 300 Thread Count Duvet/Comforter Cover Set that comes in VIBRANT COLORS and in which it is SOFT and COMFORTABLE to the touch. And Finally, to complete the set we added the matching Sheet Set including Flat Sheet, Fitted Sheet and Pillowcases (100% Cotton and 300TC) so YOU CAN WRAP YOURSELF IN SOFTNESS and COMFORT of our linens! *HOW TO ASSEMBLE YOUR BEDDING SET: You simply insert the White Comforter (Duvet Insert) into the duvet/comforter cover with button enclosures at the bottom, this will protect your comforter and keep it easy maintenance. Put your sheets on the bed and insert your pillows in their cases and you are ready to enjoy a good night's sleep! * -We offer our Bed in a Bag in 4 different sizes: Full, Queen, King and California King- which is PERFECT for YOU and YOUR FAMILY or even as a GIFT to a Loved One. ORDER NOW and BEGIN YOUR SWEET DREAMS!! *NOTE* The Goose Down Comforter is packed tightly during shipping. Upon receipt, remove it from their packaging, fluff gently and allow several hours to recover their full loft. In addition, being sealed in plastic packaging sometimes causes the scent of these natural products to concentrate to a disagreeable level. A few hours of airing the comforter usually removes the odor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PKVU6S+rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sheetsnthings","source_asin":"B07BF79LRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BF79LRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BF79LRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":517216,"name":"VEVELU 6 Pack Sublimation Tumblers 20 oz Skinny Straight - Stainless Steel 20 oz Sublimation Tumbler Blank with Lids and Double Straws，Double Wall Ins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ewVDs8UtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Coating and Unique DIY Ideas】 VEVELU 20 oz skinny tumbler is painted by a layerof quality sublimation coating for a great glossy finish，great for heat transfer DIY making, so you can add any design you want on it by heat press or oven. This is a special gift for friends or family. This sublimation cup is perfect for home, office, travel, beach party and camping. 【Skinny Tumblers for Sublimation】 The 20 oz sublimation tumbler skinny straight is completely straight not tapered, the sublimation tumbler is made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, no rust, no condensation，double-wall vacuum insulated thermal design is keeping your drinks hot for over 9 hours or cold for over 12 hours , so you can use it in any season. This sublimation tumblers makes companion for any drinks. 【Splash Proof and Dual Straws】 Our blank tumblers comes with asilicone-sealed sliding lid to keep any dust particles getting in and stopmajor spills.The straw hole on the sublimation cupslid that makes it convenient for you to insert straw. Come with a siliconebase to avoid sublimation cups sliding andreduce noise. Plastic straws are suitable for hot drinks and stainless steel straws are suitable for cold drinks,the straw is completed with a straw cleaning brush for easy cleaning of straws. 【How to Sublimation Blanks Tumbler】 If you choose heat press machine to sublimation tumblers, set temperature to 302 ～ 356 degrees F for 30 ～ 40 seconds. If you choose oven to sublimation tumblers, set temperature to 302 ～ 356 degrees F for 5 ～ 6 minutes. Please Note : Accessories include heat shrink wrap, both need to be wrapped in shrink wrap. 【Excellent Value and Practical Gifts】 Blank sublimation tumblers set：6 x white sublimation blanks tumbler , 6 x straight stainless steel straw , 6 x plastic straw , 6 x sliding lid , 6 x sublimation shrink wrap , 6 x silicone base , 6 x straw cleaning brush . Everything you need is ready, matched with white individual box, this is the best choice for Christmas、Valentine’s Day、Children’s Day、Halloween、Wedding、Birthday Gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ewVDs8UtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVELU","source_asin":"B0BT7W5G3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT7W5G3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT7W5G3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
