window.products.push({"id":517299,"name":"XELA Butter Dish with Lid and Knife, Ceramic Butter Dish, Double Silicone Seal Butter Container for kitchen-Ziying","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eP33EDS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧈Super Capacity: You don't have to choose the butter box based on the brand of butter anymore. XELA upgraded version of the large-capacity butter dish which is wide and deep enough to hold eastern style butter stick (5\" x 1.25\"x 1.25\") or western style butter stick (3.5\" x 1.5\" x 1.5\") is fit for most of butter brands. It's wide and deep enough to hold at least two pieces of butter. 🧈Safety Assurance: XELA butter container is made up of non-toxic ceramic and porcelain and the lid is made of bamboo. There is a sealed silicone ring beneath the cover so it can keep the butter fresh. Our material is definitely harmless to your food. Feel free to put the dish in microwave, oven and dishwasher. 🧈Butter Dish with Knife: Made of high-hardness stainless steel,the butter knife is stiff enough to cut the butter when you want and can be washed easily. The large butter dish with knife will bring more convenience in kitchen. 🧈Unique Kiln Pattern: The kiln pattern design makes the butter keeper looks fantastic on the table, which complements any table setup and dinnerware, and make your countertop unique. Ideal gift for yourself, family, friends or anyone you love. ⭐No Worries After Sale: Because of the unique process characteristics of reactive glazes, we cannot guarantee that the butter crock can you receive will be exactly the same as in the picture. If you are not satisfied with the kiln pattern, please contact our customer service. We will definitely give a satisfy result to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eP33EDS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xela","source_asin":"B0B2D89LG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2D89LG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2D89LG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
