window.products.push({"id":517323,"name":"Waterproof Breathable Mattress Protector, King Size Noiseless Premium Smooth Mattress Encasement, Deep Pocket Fit Up to 16 Inches, Zippered Mattress C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w1bHeLFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF PROTECTOR: The silent TPU waterproof membrane of king size mattress protector protects your mattress from accidental spills. With the impermeable TPU backing, the mattress encasement will provide all six-sided waterproof protection for your mattress. Enjoy a clean and safe sleeping environment with our mattress cover. NOISELESS ZIPPERED COVER: The king mattress encasement uses an L-shaped zipper design for easy installation. It has an inner liner that offers dual protection to prevent damage to your mattress. The zipper is hidden to avoid hurting your skin. This mattress encasement is quiet, which won't disrupt your sleep and change the feeling of your mattress. BREATHABLE & COMFORTABLE: The premium mattress protector is made of durable knit polyester fabric, which forms great air circulation to expel the heat. You will feel comfortable with the exquisitely soft and smooth touch of our mattress cover. Bring comfort and healthy sleep for you. DEEP POCKET DESIGN: King size mattress protector is 78x80''. Deep pocket with a fitted style design guarantees the mattress cover can stretch up to 16 Inches. It fits most types of mattresses. No matter how you move, The mattress cover can offer comprehensive protection for the mattress and always keep it stay in place. CARE INSTRUCTION: Machine washable and dryable. Wash with cold water and under gentle cycle, tumble dry at low heat avoid damage waterproof TPU backing. Please feel free to try our product, Ruili offers 90 days refund and replacement service without question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w1bHeLFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruili","source_asin":"B089NB7K29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NB7K29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NB7K29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":517324,"name":"Eddie Bauer Oversized Down Throw, Hazelnut Regular ONE Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712HZUaIpGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It's ultralight, and at the same time, ultrawarm. Insulated with 650 fill Premium Down, our throw is perfect for the living room, guest room, or anywhere else someone wants to relax after a day full of outdoor activities. Soft polyester shell is smooth on one side, fleece on the other. Comes gift-ready, rolled and tied with a ribbon.Best Blanket(s) Ever!\"We have three of them that range from 1-4 years old. The oldest one looks just as good as the ones we got last year, and they get used ALL the time, even on our screen porch on cool summer evenings. I'd highly recommend it, and they tend to run out when it gets close to Christmas, so plan ahead! I've given a bunch as gifts, too!\"€“windycitygirl91","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712HZUaIpGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eddie Bauer","source_asin":"B086VLH3MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086VLH3MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086VLH3MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
