window.products.push({"id":517781,"name":"Tin Sign Bar Plaque | Metal Wall Decor Poster | Pink Floyd The Dark Side of the Moon 8 x 12 in. | Classic Decorative Sign for Home Kitchen Bar Room Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YzTLqUAYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for an awesome, high-quality metal sign for your bar, kitchen, or mancave? Look no further than our collection of metal tin signs! Our signs are made of eco-friendly, lightweight recycled metal and finished with durable, attractive paint. With a variety of designs to choose from, including bar signs, kitchen signs, music and bands signs, and pin-up style signs, there's something for everyone. Our signs are easy to handle and easy to hang, with rolled edges and stamped holes for hanging. You don't need a hammer and drill to hang these signs - simply use the pre-drilled holes to stick pins in the holes (when hanging on drywalls) or use double-sided tape to stick on the wall. Plus, our signs are lightweight so they will hold well with pins or double-sided tapes. Not only are our signs suitable for many places, such as bars, cafes, dining rooms, garages, beach houses, restaurants, hotels, kitchens, clubs, gardens, and more, but they also make great gift ideas for friends and family. And if you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase, we offer a no-risk, no-questions-asked money-back guarantee. So why wait? Add one of our metal tin signs to your collection today and enjoy the vintage charm and durability of these unique decorations!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YzTLqUAYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09TD4KG2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TD4KG2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TD4KG2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":517782,"name":"Scentillating Keepsakes Candle – Best Luxury Scented Candles Made from Essential Oils for Natural Fragrance - Grey Sweatpants Matter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GzqdKt43L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Grey Sweatpants Matter Grey Sweatpants Matter is the sexiest candle of our fall collection. This candle is a thirst-trapping mixture of rugged wood, amber and the right amount of frankincense & myrrh to smell like a King. Our Candles Are Hand-Made & Custom Blended Our candles are made from only the best-curated fragrances from all over the globe. Like a bar tender for scents, we create unique and luxurious scent combinations. We choose our unique blends to evoke the perfect emotion, feeling, moment, and atmosphere. The extensive choice of ingredients is made from pure and natural extracts and blended perfectly to bring you the ultimate in artisanal scents. Our premium soy candles are hand-poured in small batches in the great state of Texas to ensure quality and care are going into each and every individual candle. Each Candle Has All-Natural Double Fiber Wicks The candle wicks are made from 100% natural fibers, combined with our Soy Wax we seek to reduce the effect of harm and pollution to the environment. We understand that natural doesn't mean low quality, so our wicks, wax, and oils are hand-selected to ensure it delivers the best quality burn possible in conjunction with the wax. You only get the best from Scentillating Keepsakes candles. The double wicks are perfectly placed to ensure a complete melt pool for maximum scent throw. The wax is infused with premium natural scented oils to make sure you get the very best scent possible from nature. Made From the Highest Quality Natural Ingredients Our premium quality soy wax is hand blended with the maximum amount of fragrance oil to result in some of the best smelling candles you have ever tried! Our Candles are built to last! With a slow burn that gives you 10-oz of room-filling goodness and approximately 40-45 hours of burn time with proper candle care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GzqdKt43L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scentillating Keepsakes","source_asin":"B08PYJF7Z5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PYJF7Z5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PYJF7Z5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
