window.products.push({"id":517784,"name":"Moonsea Waterproof Zippered Pillow Protector，2 Pack Queen Size 20 x 30 Inch Pillow Protector，Pillow Covers Encasement, Pillow Case White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515KX9VQ+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Terry High Quality and 100% Waterproof: Our waterproof pillow protector are certified standard 100 by OEKO-TEX which means they are third-party tested to ensure the product is no harm to human health, meets the requirements of consumers for healthy life. And 100% waterproof membrane laminated to prevents bodily fluids, pollen, and other something harmful to your health that grow into the fibers of your pillow. Breathable and Durable membrane: Premium waterproof layer material (TPU) allows air to pass through while keeping moisture out. And this pillow protectors queen size is very durable use which can be washed more than 100 times. Smooth Fabric and Fully Enclosed: Made of soft terry knit fabric, breathable and comfortable. Meanwhile our standard pillow protector with high quality zipper, that keeps the pillow in place, prevent slipping outside and provide complete protection. Size: Our queen size waterproof pillow protector measures 20\" x 30\", perfect for home bed or use in a hotel. Machine washable, dry safe on low heat. Moonsea Guarantee: The product quality you can trust so you can buy at ease. And if you have any questions about the waterproof pillow protectors, please contact us. Our customer service staff will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515KX9VQ+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonsea","source_asin":"B09V57WMQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V57WMQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V57WMQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":517785,"name":"Canterbury Complete Bed with Bonded Leather Upholstered Exterior and Nailhead Trim, Pinto Tobacco Finish, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n+6tmkRkL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","description":"The Canterbury bed is transitional in styling and lends itself to a variety of bedroom settings from rustic to contemporary. Constructed with a solid wood frame that’s ample in scale and not intimidating, the exterior of the bed is upholstered in bonded leather with a Pinto Tobacco finish that adds a unique look to this bedroom piece. The 56-inch headboard has a spaced nailhead trim that lends detail to the simple lines of the bed. The overall look is enhanced with a low footboard and side rails. A slat system will provide full support to your mattress and box spring. The Canterbury Bed give your master or guest room a fresh and exciting look that will last for years to come. A good ornamental (or fashionable) bed will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent your other bedroom furniture and transform a room from ordinary into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit measures 56-inches (H) x 81-inches (W) x 90.5-inches (L), and includes a headboard, bed, bed support, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for assembly. The Fashion Bed Group Canterbury Complete Bed comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n+6tmkRkL._AC_SL1471_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B00JVPG5ZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JVPG5ZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JVPG5ZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
