window.products.push({"id":517954,"name":"Light my Fire Travel Utensil Holder - Travel Cutlery Case Made of Recycled Merino Wool - Utensil Carrying Case Made in Sweden - Cutlery Holder for Lun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hz1TiZXpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE UTENSIL HOLDER FOR LUNCH BAG CUTLERY - This cutlery bag has been made in Sweden from off-cuts of merino wool produced by the Swedish brand Woolpower. With them we make sure to use all materials being left over from their production process. No fabric is going to waste, instead the rest material can become a beautiful silverware holder, such as this one. A PRACTICAL & RINSABLE TRAVEL UTENSIL POUCH - The perfect way to carry your personal, sustainably made, reusable cutlery combinations in style. This cutlery pouch is perfect for carrying your travel cutlery set or your utensils when being out hiking or camping. Its design is light, sturdy and beautifully presentable with an appearance suited to your needs whether dining at a restaurant or eating in the great outdoors. UTENSIL HOLDER WITH SPACE FOR SEVERAL CUTLERY - This case measures 21 x 6 cm (8,27 x 2,36 In). The utensil case can hold several Sporks, your straws or your own set of utensils in a clean, secure and smart way. Great for your lunch kit, picnic basket, briefcase, bag, backpack or inside pocket. Get noticed for the right reasons with this ruggedly stylish, sustainable and functional case. PACKAGE CONTENT - A Reusable utensil pouch - 1 x \"On The Go Cutlery Case\". High quality case made of recycled Merino wool. You can rinse the case with running water. It should not be machine washed. Straw carrying case made of the recycled merino wool from Woolpower’s garment production waste. The colour can vary depending on the different colours of clothes. Minimum 50% merino wool and maximum 50% synthetic. CAMPING CUTLERY CASE PRODUCED IN SWEDEN - Light My Fire is a Swedish brand that creates products that reconnect us with nature, wherever we are. No matter which product you choose, its design, color and function are just as attractive and work in the city as in the wild. All plastic parts are made from bio-based plastics - for a more sustainable future. Light My Fire´s products are made, designed and developed in Sweden.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hz1TiZXpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Light my Fire","source_asin":"B08M96QKTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M96QKTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M96QKTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
