window.products.push({"id":517961,"name":"New Item Travel Happy 10 inch plush short queen (60 x 75 inches) Cooler Sleep Graphite Gel Memory Foam Mattress with Premium Textured 8-Way Stretch Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":649.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TlNGOoJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This listing is for a NEW softer 10 inch short queen (60 x 75 inches) Our 10 inch mattress has two inches of conforming graphite gel memory foam over 2 inches of transition foam over 6 inches of support foam for a softer and plush comfort. We ship your mattress either today or the next day. What could be easier and we will deliver right to your door with zero shipping costs. Construction We are using a white textured eight-way stretch fabric that looks and feels luxurious with a pebble gray border. Our graphite cooling gel is next generation as it is immursed throughout the memory foam so our foam is cooler and more comfortable than foam with only gel infused beads. Soft or Plush support - Our open cell Visco elastic foam allows air to move easily throughout the mattress helping to regulate temperature keeping you more comfortable Our mattress will reduce motion transfer as the foam absorbs movement so you don’t disturb your partner Our mattress provides individual support for everyone so you can sleep in any sleep position Our mattress comes complete with a cover already on the mattress We make your mattress when you order it and ship in one day. Our mattress arrives in a vacuum sealed package…Once opened please allow one day to allow the foam to fully expand and note that memory foam has a new foam smell that will dissipate in a day or two. Just like the new foam in a car, upholstered furniture or a new office chair. Our mattress will work perfectly with any box spring, flat platform or adjustable base Our mattress passes or exceeds all 1633 and 1632 fire safety standards. Our mattress is first quality and not a closeout Our mattress has a 10 year warranty Our mattress has been tested and accredited by Certi-PUR US to meet or exceed strict standards for content, and emission. We are 100% Hand-Made in America including our fabric, foam and our labor and our finished size may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TlNGOoJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Travel Happy","source_asin":"B08KVNKN4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-517961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KVNKN4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KVNKN4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
